## Output — CSP Icons Fix Applied

### 1. Changes Made

Both CSP headers were updated to allow `https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com` in both `style-src` and `font-src` directives:

#### File 1: `frontend/nginx.conf` (line 16)

**Before:**
```nginx
add_header Content-Security-Policy "default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://fonts.googleapis.com; font-src https://fonts.gstatic.com; ..." always;
```

**After:**
```nginx
add_header Content-Security-Policy "default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://fonts.googleapis.com https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com; font-src 'self' data: https://fonts.gstatic.com https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com; ..." always;
```

#### File 2: `gateway/app/main.py` (~ line 104, inside `add_security_headers`)

**Before:**
```python
"style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://fonts.googleapis.com; "
"font-src https://fonts.gstatic.com; "
```

**After:**
```python
"style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://fonts.googleapis.com https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com; "
"font-src 'self' data: https://fonts.gstatic.com https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com; "
```

### 2. Next Steps for Deployment

1. **Run gateway tests:**
   ```bash
   pytest gateway/tests/test_gateway.py
   ```

2. **Rebuild and restart Docker containers:**
   ```bash
   docker compose up -d --build frontend gateway
   ```

3. **Browser verification:**
   - Open DevTools Console (`F12`) — confirm **zero CSP violation errors**.
   - Hard refresh (`Ctrl + F5`) to clear cached CSS/fonts.
   - Verify all previously missing icons are restored.

